What is RTA Furniture?
RTA (Ready-to-assemble) furniture represents a category of products that are shipped unassembled directly to end-users, who then assemble the items at their location using simple tools. The product range spans a comprehensive array of residential and office furniture solutions. These items are delivered in flat-packed boxes and typically packaged as a comprehensive kit containing all necessary furniture components, hardware, and typically illustrated, step-by-step assembly instructions.
